# The quick gate is real compute, so it runs under the pinned HIPPO guard the
# same way every other heavy task in this maintainer's repositories does.
# HIPPO cannot guard HIPPO; RHINO has no such constraint, so it does not exempt
# itself. Exit 75 means the host was busy: retry, never bypass.
./hippo run --class ephemeral --disk-path . -- cargo xtask test-quick
